{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1538389-alchemists-discover-the-hedge","id":1538389,"title":"Alchemists discover the Hedge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-10T14:49:23-07:00","id":1538389,"title":"Alchemists discover the Hedge","content":"Prometheans are hard to find, and rendering the Pinocchios for their Pyros feels kind of bad. (Not that bad \u2013 they are <i>loathsome</i>, and have no idea how good they have it, but, you know, some.) In the Hedge, on the other had, Glamour literally grows on trees. There are Pandorans who can subsist on Glamour just as if it were Pyros \u2013 wouldn't it be great if you could figure out how?<br /> <br /> It's going to be a lengthy process \u2013 you need to develop the Blight and Lordship Alembics, and then you have to get into the Hedge on purpose (not that easy,) cook some Wastelands there, and then blow them up. You won't necessarily get the right kind of Pandorans the first time. When you do, you'll have to control those Pandorans and study what makes them different. But when you find out how their hunger works, you can take it. Then you'll have the ability to stew Goblin Fruits for Pyros. Probably worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-19T10:08:37-07:00","id":1538904,"title":"","content":"The Autum Court would probably be interested in partnering with these researchers, giving them safe passage to the Hedge. They might arguably be interested if one could create a Wasteland that is damaging to the Hedge itself. But since the Hedge itself is psychoreactive, this could also go horribly wrong.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-19T11:26:36-07:00","id":1538908,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1538389-alchemists-discover-the-hedge?p=1538904#post1538904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Autum Court would probably be interested in partnering with these researchers, giving them safe passage to the Hedge. They might arguably be interested if one could create a Wasteland that is damaging to the Hedge itself. But since the Hedge itself is psychoreactive, this could also go horribly wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>Autumn might want to see what happens - it's Summer, or Bridge-Burners (is there a difference? depends on your city) who would want to <i>use </i>it.<br /> Scoring Glamour-eating Pandorans would be an example of it going horribly <i>right</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-19T11:54:56-07:00","id":1538910,"title":"","content":"The Hedge can react in a number of unpredictable ways, even birthing Goblin Fruits that actually provide Pyros directly.<br /> <br /> So as important as it is to run the experiments, is to explore and see what else the Hedge itself is concocting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-19T12:00:08-07:00","id":1538911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1538389-alchemists-discover-the-hedge?p=1538910#post1538910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Hedge can react in a number of unpredictable ways, even birthing Goblin Fruits that actually provide Pyros directly.<br /> <br /> So as important as it is to run the experiments, is to explore and see what else the Hedge itself is concocting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course the Hedge can do anything, but its main activity is three card monte-ing you to death or enslavement. It would be typical of it to give you <i>one</i> sweet juicy pyros, and lay clues that there's more to be had deeper in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-19T12:17:49-07:00","id":1538913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1538389-alchemists-discover-the-hedge?p=1538904#post1538904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Autum Court would probably be interested in partnering with these researchers, giving them safe passage to the Hedge. They might arguably be interested if one could create a Wasteland that is damaging to the Hedge itself. But since the Hedge itself is psychoreactive, this could also go horribly wrong.</div> </div> </div> </div>In re: your signature, there are always going to be fifteen Great Legacies - five Perfect and ten Imperial. The Perfect Legacies leave you with no Inferior Arcanum; the Imperial Legacies give you a single super-Arcanum, as per Mage Chronicler's Guide. Over time, new Great Legacies supplant old, and their particular philosophies and attainments will vary.- but there will always be fifteen of them, and they will always be the &quot;magnet&quot; Legacies, for which many mages will stifle their own philosophical disagreement. After all, once you have the power, you can change the world - even reform your Legacy. Right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-20T10:47:04-07:00","id":1538947,"title":"","content":"What would be an Imperial one in this case ? If I recall <i>Imperial Mysteries</i>, pushing your Attainments beyond the complete suite is one of the possible paths to Ascension. But those require an archmage, so did you perhaps mean one created a Legacy &quot;built into&quot; certain souls, which they would manifest if they Awaken and reach a certain tier of power ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-20T12:28:32-07:00","id":1538949,"title":"","content":"An Imperial Arcanum is just one that is Ruling twice, once from a Path and once from a Legacy. It's a concept only discussed in Chronicler's Guide. Old rules, it made the cost of that one Arcanum new dots x5. Current equivalent would be take three Beats when you gain a dot in that Arcanum. Possibly they should be Arcane Beats.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I think I'm the only person who calls this an Imperial Arcanum. It think it's just a sidebar entitled &quot;Double Ruling&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28549,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","user":"Sikander","date":". 07-20-2024, 03:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-21T09:14:38-07:00","id":1538971,"title":"","content":"Ah, got it. Normally Imperial Arcana refers to the Practices of 6 dots and above, which are normally the purview of archmages.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}